From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tcmichals <tcmichals@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 10:55:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: allwinner: add sun60i-a733-cubie-a7a device tree

Add comprehensive device tree support for the Radxa Cubie A7A single board
computer powered by the Allwinner A733 SoC (2x Cortex-A76 + 6x Cortex-A55,
XuanTie E907/E902 RISC-V co-processor).

Signed-off-by: tcmichals <tcmichals@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/Makefile                   |    1 +
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733-cubie-a7a.dts | 2564 ++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 2565 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733-cubie-a7a.dts

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/Makefile
